<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tipsex13"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2015-10-27</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Volkswirtschaftliche Gesamtrechnungen Indikator (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">National accounts indicator (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur des comptes nationaux (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Export market shares in volume</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;The indicator is calculated by subtracting the world exports volume growth rate from the country exports volume growth rate. Eurostat&apos;s National accounts volumes for exports (as for all transactions concerning goods and services) are estimated in previous year prices to eliminate the influence of inflation. The volume growth rate is always calculated by comparing the year Y volume in previous year prices with the year Y-1 figure in current prices. The indicator is expressed as percentage change comparing year Y with year Y-1. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data sources: Eurostat, online data code: nama_10_gdp (country&apos;s exports of goods and services) and IMF, World Economic Outlook (WEO) – world exports of goods and services.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Part de marché des exportations en volume</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">&lt;p&gt;L&apos;indicateur est calculé en prenant la différence entre le taux de croissance du volume des exportations mondiales et le taux de croissance du volume des exportations de pays. Dans les Comptes nationaux d&apos;Eurostat, les volumes des exportations (pour toutes les transactions concernant des biens et services) sont estimés aux prix de l&apos;année précédente pour éliminer l&apos;influence de l&apos;inflation. Le taux de croissance du volume est à chaque fois calculé en comparant le volume de l&apos;an Y aux prix de l&apos;année précédente au volume de l&apos;année Y - 1 en prix courants. L&apos;indicateur est exprimé en terme de variation de l&apos;année Y sur l&apos;année Y-1. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Source: Eurostat, code nama_10_gdp (pour les exportations de biens et services des pays) et FMI , World Economic Outlook (WEO )(pour les exportations mondiales de biens et services).&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Exportmarktanteil gemessen am Volumen</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">&lt;p&gt;Der Indikator wird durch Subtraktion der Wachstumsrate des Weltexportvolumens von der Wachstumsrate des Exportvolumens des Landes berechnet. Im Rahmen der Volkswirtschaftlichen Gesamtrechnungen von Eurostat werden die Exportvolumen (wie alle Waren und Dienstleistungen betreffenden Transaktionen) in Vorjahrespreisen veranschlagt, um den Einfluss der Inflation zu eliminieren. Die volumenmäßige Wachstumsrate wird stets berechnet, indem das Volumen des Jahres Y in Vorjahrespreisen mit der Angabe des Jahres Y-1 in jeweiligen Preisen verglichen wird. Der Indikator wird als prozentuale Veränderung im Jahr Y gegenüber dem Jahr Y-1 angegeben. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Datenquellen: Eurostat, Online-Daten-Code: nama_10_gdp (Waren- und Dienstleistungsexporte des Landes) und IWF, World Economic Outlook (WEO) – weltweite Exporte von Waren und Dienstleistungen.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:identifier>tipsex13</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsex13"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/NA_ITEM" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Volkswirtschaftliche Gesamtrechnungen Indikator (ESVG 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">National accounts indicator (ESA 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur des comptes nationaux (SEC 2010)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=CLV_PCH_PRE"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Verkettete Volumen, Veränderung in Prozent gegenüber der Vorperiode</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Chain linked volumes, percentage change on previous period</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Volumes chaînés, variation en pourcentage par rapport à la période précédente</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">29</stat:numSeries><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-05-15</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">1995-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-12-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsex13"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databr